TCL_ERROR       1       ERROR: Options are mutually exclusive: <string>. Specify
 only one of the these options.
TCL_ERROR       1       ERROR: Object with ID "<string>" is not an object of typ
e <string>. Specify the ID of an object with the correct type.
TCL_ERROR       1       ERROR: Cannot find object of ID "<string>". Specify an e
xisting object ID.
TCL_ERROR       1       ERROR: Unsupported object type: <string>. Specify a supp
orted object type.

